# Build artifacts. These were tracked, which is what produced the recurring
# "chore: rebuild tsbuildinfo cache" commits — the file changes on every build.
# Untrack them once with:
#   git rm --cached tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
#   git rm --cached -r scripts/__pycache__
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
__pycache__/
*.pyc
